\toc1 Proverbs
\mt1 Good words and stories
\mt2 (From the book in the Holy Bible called \em Proverbs\em*)
\c 3
\q1
\v 5 You have to trust in God properly, you have to only trust in him.
\q1 Don’t trust the things you know, you don’t know everything.
\q1
\v 6 Always think about God in everything that you do.
\q1 If you do that, he will show you the right way to live.
